{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんわかつき(｀_´)ゞ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼オフ月！もうほぼ何もしてない状態(笑)服もデカトレーナー１枚!!／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/18/3639177/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この写メは少し前なんだけどね！基本的にオフでお家で１人でお布団とじゃれあっている時はこんな感じで...え？あ、べべべ別に、さ、寂しくはないぞ！泣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というわけで、始まりました若月ブログ♪(/ω＼*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うーん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近感じたことを書こうかなと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"team*若月が私は大好きだってこと...。感じました。本当に。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんからの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントを見たり、お手紙読んだりする時...私いつもいつも泣きそうになるんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の事をこんなにも考えてくれて、頑張れって言ってくださる方がいる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月なら大丈夫だよ。と優しい言葉をかけてくださる方がいる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなダメダメな私の中から良いとこを見つけてくれる方がいる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家族と離れて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１人で暮らしている今。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『ただいま』と投げ掛けても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『お